    "title": "4th Annual Friends of 4-H Banquet to be held on Saturday, August 29th - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By jacksonparishjournal ,\n1 days ago The time for the 4th annual Friends of 4-H Banquet is almost here, with the always-entertaining fundraising event, where all proceeds stay in Jackson Parish to support the local youth, scheduled for August 29th at the Charles H. Garrett Community Center in Jonesboro, LA. The doors will open at 5:30 p.m., with the meal beginning at 6:00 p.m., followed by live and silent auctions, bucket raffles, games, and prizes. Read full article\n1",
